{"step_index":3178,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-28T17:12:00Z","input_tokens":2931,"cache_read_tokens":145917,"output_tokens":817,"content":"I have eliminated those empty side spaces in the **DSA Learning Hub** as well.\n\n---\n\n### Root Cause\nIn [`app_build/styles.css`](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/app_build/styles.css#L3316-L3326), `.dsa-learning-container` and `.workspace-wrapper` were constrained by fixed `max-width` and centered with `margin: 0 auto;`. On wide desktop monitors (1080p, 1440p, 4K), this caused the entire DSA dashboard to box into a narrow column in the center, leaving the massive empty white gutters on the left and right that your green arrows pointed to.\n\n---\n\n### Fixes Applied\n\n1. **Full-Width Fluid DSA Container**:\n   * Updated `.dsa-learning-container` in [`app_build/styles.css`](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/app_build/styles.css#L3316-L3326) to:\n     ```css\n     .dsa-learning-container {\n       width: 100%;\n       max-width: 100%;\n       margin: 0;\n       box-sizing: border-box;\n       padding: 20px 24px 60px;\n       display: flex;\n       flex-direction: column;\n       gap: 20px;\n     }\n     ```\n   * The container now matches the full width of the top navigation bar, with consistent 24px horizontal padding and zero dead side margins.\n\n2. **Fluid Metrics Grid & Cards**:\n   * Removed fixed text caps (`max-width: 860px`, `max-width: 900px`) from `.dsa-subtitle` and `.continue-hero-desc` so text and hero banners flow smoothly across the full width.\n   * The 6 metric cards (`300 Curated Problems`, `0 Problems Solved`, `2 In Progress`, etc.) now stretch evenly across the entire row without cramped margins.\n   * The two-column section (`Difficulty Breakdown` + `Recent Sessions` on the left, `10-Stage Learning Roadmap` on the right) now spans the full desktop width.\n\n3. **Full-Width Problem Learning Workspace**:\n   * Updated `.workspace-wrapper` in [`app_build/styles.css`](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/app_build/styles.css#L5619-L5626) to `width: 100%; max-width: 100%; margin: 0; box-sizing: border-box;`.\n   * When opening any of the 300 curated problems, the dedicated learning workspace (Sections A & B on the left, Python editor & Visualizer on the right) also stretches smoothly across the screen without empty gutters.\n\n---\n\n### Verification\n* **Phase 10 Master Validation Suite**: **28 / 28 tests passed (100%)**\n* **Phase 5 Full Regression Audit**: **82 / 82 tests passed (100%)**\n* Both the **Code Visualizer** and the **DSA Learning Hub** are now fluid, edge-to-edge, and free of empty side margins."}
